.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK REPLAY"
.SH NAME
hamstik replay \- Show recent failed\-request journal entries for support correlation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik replay [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show recent failed\-request journal entries for support correlation
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --last
Number of most recent failed-request journal entries to show. The journal is local-only and is never sent automatically; `replay` reads it and prints it without making any network request
Default: 20
